    "detailed_description": "Baggage Inspector\u2026 a job title that speaks excitement! Passion! Adventure! Or\u2026 maybe not. Ok. Definitely not. Can you imagine a less exciting job, than standing at a conveyor belt, taking suitcase after suitcase, fiddling with their locks, opening, closing, pulling them through the computer scanner, dragging them to the correct dispatch gate\u2026 oh, and discovering drugs, firearms, and\u2026 wait, are those explosives? What do you mean, they\u2019re primed to go off? Is that an active countdown timer?!<br><br>In Baggage Inspector, you put on the gloves of a brand new inspector, commencing training at the futuristic Interplanetary Transfer Station, where you will control the flow of traffic between Earth and the mining colonies on the Outer Planets. But before you even begin this assignment, you must first learn on the job. And what better way to learn, than\u2026 in a virtual reality simulated scenario? Step into VR-within-VR, where you will train by checking bags for the oppressive regime of Redlandia, where nothing is what it seems.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768020/extras/01ac67c4ea209233a64056460570dd79.avif?t=1730139993\" width=616 height=183 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768020/extras/7a0cfd3a53989f6c01c63532801fcf44.poster.avif?t=1730139993\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768020/extras/7a0cfd3a53989f6c01c63532801fcf44.webm?t=1730139993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768020/extras/7a0cfd3a53989f6c01c63532801fcf44.mp4?t=1730139993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Had fun with all those simulator games? We did too! But there was something missing, something we couldn\u2019t put our fingers on\u2026 yes, that\u2019s it! Hands! Baggage Inspector is the next step in your VR journey: use your controllers as gloves, grab things by wrapping your virtual fingers around them, and\u2026 be careful, that\u2019s a heavy case! Use both hands at once. With Baggage Inspector, you can train yourself for more advanced VR titles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768020/extras/94ffcdca83c4746cfc8d9af975a9adb0.avif?t=1730139993\" width=616 height=183 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768020/extras/a534db291c0e9b6e92399e1491351527.poster.avif?t=1730139993\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768020/extras/a534db291c0e9b6e92399e1491351527.webm?t=1730139993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768020/extras/a534db291c0e9b6e92399e1491351527.mp4?t=1730139993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Think suitcases are all the same? Think again! You will open a variety of different locks, from ordinary button-operated ones, through zippers, and keycode locks. Then there\u2019s those cases that just won\u2019t open without the help of your trusty knife. And those filled with concealed bio-contaminants you just won\u2019t detect without your Sniffer Tool. Did we mention some concealed items will only reveal themselves on the x-ray scanner? Let\u2019s not even mention the Spray Tool. Expensive bags, precious contents, and spray paint - what could go wrong?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768020/extras/bf0836506205a1e5fad6392e5930a552.avif?t=1730139993\" width=616 height=183 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768020/extras/1a832ba3aafd8ad979ae7123de346b40.poster.avif?t=1730139993\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768020/extras/1a832ba3aafd8ad979ae7123de346b40.webm?t=1730139993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768020/extras/1a832ba3aafd8ad979ae7123de346b40.mp4?t=1730139993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Not ready for VR? No problem! Baggage inspector allows you to also play on a traditional flatscreen, using mouse and keyboard.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768020/extras/fbbfa5365dcebd97f51a5a3bb87ef7ad.avif?t=1730139993\" width=616 height=183 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768020/extras/1c6f5748ac8ff88a5b4e803f37559cec.poster.avif?t=1730139993\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768020/extras/1c6f5748ac8ff88a5b4e803f37559cec.webm?t=1730139993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768020/extras/1c6f5748ac8ff88a5b4e803f37559cec.mp4?t=1730139993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>No two bags are ever alike, and no day\u2019s job is ever the same, resulting in an ever-changing story. Play as much as you like!",
    "about_the_game": "Baggage Inspector\u2026 a job title that speaks excitement! Passion! Adventure! Or\u2026 maybe not. Ok. Definitely not. Can you imagine a less exciting job, than standing at a conveyor belt, taking suitcase after suitcase, fiddling with their locks, opening, closing, pulling them through the computer scanner, dragging them to the correct dispatch gate\u2026 oh, and discovering drugs, firearms, and\u2026 wait, are those explosives? What do you mean, they\u2019re primed to go off? Is that an active countdown timer?!<br><br>In Baggage Inspector, you put on the gloves of a brand new inspector, commencing training at the futuristic Interplanetary Transfer Station, where you will control the flow of traffic between Earth and the mining colonies on the Outer Planets. But before you even begin this assignment, you must first learn on the job. And what better way to learn, than\u2026 in a virtual reality simulated scenario? Step into VR-within-VR, where you will train by checking bags for the oppressive regime of Redlandia, where nothing is what it seems.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768020/extras/01ac67c4ea209233a64056460570dd79.avif?t=1730139993\" width=616 height=183 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768020/extras/7a0cfd3a53989f6c01c63532801fcf44.poster.avif?t=1730139993\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768020/extras/7a0cfd3a53989f6c01c63532801fcf44.webm?t=1730139993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768020/extras/7a0cfd3a53989f6c01c63532801fcf44.mp4?t=1730139993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Had fun with all those simulator games? We did too! But there was something missing, something we couldn\u2019t put our fingers on\u2026 yes, that\u2019s it! Hands! Baggage Inspector is the next step in your VR journey: use your controllers as gloves, grab things by wrapping your virtual fingers around them, and\u2026 be careful, that\u2019s a heavy case! Use both hands at once. With Baggage Inspector, you can train yourself for more advanced VR titles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768020/extras/94ffcdca83c4746cfc8d9af975a9adb0.avif?t=1730139993\" width=616 height=183 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768020/extras/a534db291c0e9b6e92399e1491351527.poster.avif?t=1730139993\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768020/extras/a534db291c0e9b6e92399e1491351527.webm?t=1730139993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768020/extras/a534db291c0e9b6e92399e1491351527.mp4?t=1730139993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Think suitcases are all the same? Think again! You will open a variety of different locks, from ordinary button-operated ones, through zippers, and keycode locks. Then there\u2019s those cases that just won\u2019t open without the help of your trusty knife. And those filled with concealed bio-contaminants you just won\u2019t detect without your Sniffer Tool. Did we mention some concealed items will only reveal themselves on the x-ray scanner? Let\u2019s not even mention the Spray Tool. Expensive bags, precious contents, and spray paint - what could go wrong?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768020/extras/bf0836506205a1e5fad6392e5930a552.avif?t=1730139993\" width=616 height=183 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768020/extras/1a832ba3aafd8ad979ae7123de346b40.poster.avif?t=1730139993\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768020/extras/1a832ba3aafd8ad979ae7123de346b40.webm?t=1730139993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768020/extras/1a832ba3aafd8ad979ae7123de346b40.mp4?t=1730139993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Not ready for VR? No problem! Baggage inspector allows you to also play on a traditional flatscreen, using mouse and keyboard.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768020/extras/fbbfa5365dcebd97f51a5a3bb87ef7ad.avif?t=1730139993\" width=616 height=183 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768020/extras/1c6f5748ac8ff88a5b4e803f37559cec.poster.avif?t=1730139993\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768020/extras/1c6f5748ac8ff88a5b4e803f37559cec.webm?t=1730139993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768020/extras/1c6f5748ac8ff88a5b4e803f37559cec.mp4?t=1730139993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>No two bags are ever alike, and no day\u2019s job is ever the same, resulting in an ever-changing story. Play as much as you like!",
